WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.680
This summer, I'm just going to relax.

00:00:05.000 --> 00:00:06.840
Okay, relax and maybe run.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:10.320
But mostly relax. And run.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:11.720
Then swim.

00:00:11.720 --> 00:00:16.120
So: relax, run, swim,
and hike to the highest peak.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:19.580
Relax, run, swim, hike,
and flip huge truck tyres.

00:00:19.580 --> 00:00:24.000
Okay: relax, run, swim, hike, flip tyres,
and get a black belt in taekwondo.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:24.660
Wait.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.180
Still relaxing?
